  "body": "### What is the issue with the DOM Standard?\n\nPlease consider mentioning the full form of \"DOM\", i.e. \"Document Object Model \", at least once at the start of the document.\n\nFor instance, in the abstract instead of:\n> DOM defines a platform-neutral model for events, aborting activities, and node trees.\n\nIt could be:\n>Document Object Model (DOM) defines a platform-neutral model for events, aborting activities, and node trees.\n",
